{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03406","headline":"饯唐州高使君赴任 · 崔湜","name":"饯唐州高使君赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳春桃李时，京都物华好。\n爲岳岂不贵，所悲涉远道。\n远道不可思，宿昔梦见之。\n赠君双佩刀，日夕视来期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}